quicktype (Rust port)

This is a port of quicktype (https://github.com/glideapps/quicktype),
Copyright (c) 2017-present Glide Apps and the quicktype contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The test inputs in tests/inputs are copied unmodified from quicktype.
The expected outputs in tests/golden are generated by running quicktype
(npm run golden); they are not part of the repository. The corrected
outputs in tests/intended are quicktype's outputs with the bugs listed in
tests/intended-differences.txt fixed.

The release archives of the quickertype CLI, and its Homebrew, npm and MSI
installs, include the TypeScript compiler by Microsoft Corp.
(https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript), unmodified: the npm package
@typescript/typescript-<os>-<arch> for their platform, in a typescript
directory next to quickertype (share/quickertype/typescript with
Homebrew). It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE in
that directory), and its third-party notices are in NOTICE.txt there.
